---
source: tests/surface_snapshots.rs
expression: "help(&[verb])"
---
Print the shell-completion activation snippet

Usage: mnemex completion <SHELL>

Arguments:
  <SHELL>
          The shell whose activation snippet to print

          Possible values:
          - bash:       Bash
          - zsh:        Zsh
          - fish:       Fish
          - elvish:     Elvish
          - powershell: PowerShell

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
